kers)\n2. There\'s a good chance both opponents will pass, giving me consecutive free plays to empty my hand\n3. I preserve my Rocket for emergency situations\n4. Playing high cards early while ahead helps maintain initiative and control\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣K"]}'}
